// A renters insurance policy between Harbor Mutual and Nora Quinn (policy.md).
Document "policy.md"

Fact insurer Identified by HarborMutual
Fact insured Identified by Nora
Fact party Identified by HarborMutual, Nora
Fact adjuster Identified by Ines
Fact usd Identified by Money(USD, 2)
Param premium : Money(USD, 2) = 2000
Param deductible : Money(USD, 2) = 50000
Param limit : Money(USD, 2) = 2000000

// R.1 The policy: in force until cancelled; a loss is in the policy if it happens meanwhile
Bool in-force
  Holds when Not(Held(cancellation-noticed()) For 10)
Fact loss
Fact in-policy Identified by loss
Event loss-happens Related to loss
  Creates loss, notice-due()
        , in-policy(loss) When in-force()

// R.2 Premium
Event month-begins
  Creates premium-due() When in-force()
Duty premium-due Holder insured Claimant insurer
  Due within 1
  Terminated by pay-premium
Act pay-premium Actor insured Recipient insurer Related to usd
  Valid when usd >= premium
  Terminates cancellation-noticed() When in-force()

// R.3 What is covered; R.4 What is not covered
Fact cause Identified by Theft, Fire, Flood, OwnAct, Wear
Evidenced Fact caused-by Identified by loss * cause
Fact covered Identified by loss
  Default theft-or-fire
    Holds when in-policy(loss) && (caused-by(loss, Theft) || caused-by(loss, Fire))
  Exception flood Overrides theft-or-fire Rejects when caused-by(loss, Flood)
  Exception on-purpose Overrides theft-or-fire Rejects when caused-by(loss, OwnAct)
  Exception ordinary-wear Overrides theft-or-fire Rejects when caused-by(loss, Wear)
  Exception late-notice Overrides theft-or-fire Rejects when Not(noticed(loss))
  Exception cause-in-dispute Overrides theft-or-fire
    Rejects when (Exists cause: Conflicted(caused-by(loss, cause)))

// R.5 Limit and deductible
Function value Identified by loss * usd
Function payable Identified by loss * usd
  Derived from payable(value.loss, value.usd - deductible)
                 When covered(value.loss) && value.usd > deductible
                   && value.usd - deductible <= limit
             , payable(value.loss, limit)
                 When covered(value.loss) && value.usd - deductible > limit

// R.6 Notice and proof of loss
Duty notice-due Holder insured Claimant insurer Related to loss
  Due within 30
  Terminated by give-notice
Fact noticed Identified by loss
Act give-notice Actor insured Recipient insurer Related to loss
  Valid when Not(Violated(notice-due()))
  Creates noticed()
Fact stated Identified by party * loss * cause
Act prove-loss Actor insured Recipient insurer Related to loss, cause, usd
  Holds when noticed()
  Supports caused-by()
  Creates value(), stated(insured, loss, cause)

// R.7 Payment
Duty claim-due Holder insurer Claimant insured Related to loss
  Holds when (Exists payable: payable.loss == loss)
  Due within 30
  Terminated by pay-claim
Act pay-claim Actor insurer Recipient insured Related to loss, usd
  Valid when payable()

// R.8 Disputed cause
Act state-cause Actor insurer Recipient insured Related to loss, cause
  Holds when True
  Supports caused-by()
  Creates stated(insurer, loss, cause)
Act dispute-cause Actor party Related to loss, cause
  Holds when (Exists party': party' != party && stated(party', loss, cause))
  Rebuts caused-by()
Fact answer Identified by Yes, No
Finding decide-cause Actor adjuster Related to loss, cause, answer
  Resolves caused-by() When answer == Yes
  Resolves !caused-by() When answer == No
  Holds when Conflicted(caused-by())
  Valid when Conflicted(caused-by())

// R.9 Cancellation
Bool cancellation-noticed
Power give-cancellation-notice Actor insurer Recipient insured
  Holds when Violated(premium-due())
  Valid when Violated(premium-due())
  Creates cancellation-noticed()

Clause R.1 Approved "44bd1b68db07fa847bf633ad06fb061727d1030b80fc3b4df9a598a28cfb95a8"
  Definition "Harbor Mutual, the insurer, insures Nora Quinn, the insured, for her personal property at Flat 4, 12 Mill Lane."
  Norm " This policy covers a loss that happens while it is in force." => pay-claim
Clause R.2 Approved "13f4573d17fc1c38b81a686613286bfcd1e8c2351c0ffbe5aed78d6e803fc7fb"
  Norm "The insured pays a premium of twenty dollars for each month, due on the first day of that month." => premium-due, pay-premium
Clause R.3 Approved "b2a09dbcbc2b63ca90536825a27361cd51664551ef694e1f418d350f2a5f2e13"
  Norm "The insurer covers the loss of the insured's personal property by theft or by fire." => pay-claim
Clause R.4 Approved "8d57f3763702c8d1185f622ee433493bc4465b3f543c74e3496e166001ed24b2"
  Norm "The insurer does not cover a loss, even one by theft or fire, if flood contributed to it, if the insured caused it on purpose, or if it is ordinary wear." => pay-claim
Clause R.5 Approved "b56d98ebaf6b9066737fe5a2b3d1e3fa00d205019eed9390331bf06617d7e1f7"
  Norm "For a covered loss the insurer pays the value of the property lost, less a deductible of five hundred dollars. The insurer never pays more than twenty thousand dollars for one loss." => pay-claim
Clause R.6 Approved "9214ce1eb75065f78a2e15585fdf0103b325dcf9b6dc4e745e92f8c16a28207e"
  Norm "The insured gives the insurer notice of a loss within thirty days after it happens." => notice-due, give-notice
  Norm " The insurer owes nothing for a loss it was not given notice of within that time." => give-notice, pay-claim
  Norm " After giving notice the insured sends the insurer a proof of loss stating what was lost, its value, and its cause." => prove-loss
Clause R.7 Approved "935c7d94137a75a230554685c8805df5fd85c09ef9a23ce40bc1f7fa43bac8e1"
  Norm "The insurer pays a covered loss within thirty days after it receives the proof of loss." => claim-due, pay-claim
Clause R.8 Approved "76c01707a45c6e1c70118fb88e9f86ad299dfde92f41f4f20696773b18d98e71"
  Norm "Either party may dispute a cause the other has stated for a loss." => state-cause, dispute-cause
  Norm " Ines Okafor, the adjuster, then decides whether it was a cause of the loss, and her finding binds both parties." => decide-cause
  Norm " When a cause is disputed, the thirty days for payment run from the adjuster's finding." => claim-due
Clause R.9 Approved "69bafbdf33a4ef68a0bc4db16a43fe0fe1b6b8bfeb0825f384c09d221966121b"
  Norm "If a premium is unpaid after it is due, the insurer may give the insured notice of cancellation." => give-cancellation-notice
  Norm " This policy ends ten days after that notice, unless the insured pays the overdue premium before then." => give-cancellation-notice, pay-premium
  Norm " The insurer may not cancel this policy for any other reason." => give-cancellation-notice
.
